{"level":30,"time":1776969864735,"pid":55640,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":9,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01BLEWsVYVXL4kShDeTaykPM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! This is a critical finding. The existing conditions survey (Sheet 4) shows:\n\n1. **NO overhead utility lines (O.H.U.L.)** running across or adjacent to the property\n2. **NO utility poles** on the subject property or adjacent properties\n3. **Multiple electric easements** shown (5-foot and 6-foot electric easements)\n4. **Underground infrastructure** including:\n   - Electric pull box\n   - Cable box\n   - Underground electric easements\n\nSo the property has underground electric infrastructure (electric easements with 5-foot and 6-foot widths), but NO overhead electric facilities.\n\nHowever, I need to verify this more comprehensively. Let me also check:\n1. The site plan (Sheet 9) to see if it mentions overhead facilities\n2. The utility tap plan (Sheet 20) for any reference to overhead lines\n3. The landscape plan to see if there are any trees positioned relative to overhead lines\n\nLet me read the blocks from Sheet 9 and Sheet 19 to see if there's any mention of overhead facilities.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":11,"cache_creation_input_tokens":767,"cache_read_input_tokens":50347,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":767},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a582675-f45b-4e40-ac49-d1379f357a0d","uuid":"a4ff9acf-b203-4df0-aaca-f59e41f78b20"}
