 the letter **\"M\"**.\n*   **There are no readable species labels or specific plant codes** (e.g., abbreviations like QUVI, ULCRA) identifying the tree species next to any of these four trees.\n*   *Additional Details:* Tree 4 (East-most) has a second leader line pointing to a circle containing **\"P\"** (defined in KEY NOTES as \"PARKING BUFFER POINT TREE\") directly next to the \"M\" bubble. Tree 1 (West-most) has a very faint secondary leader line pointing to a tiny circle/text that is completely illegible (\"text unclear\").\n\n**3. Dimension Lines, Clearances, and Notes**\n*   **Clearances:** The drawn canopies of all four trees overlap the dashed \"- OHE -\" line. However, there are **no dimension lines or stated clearance distances** noted on the plan between the centers or canopies of these trees and the overhead electric line.\n*   **Notes:** A review of the \"IRRIGATION NOTES\", general \"NOTE\" section, \"KEY NOTES\", and the immediate surrounding drawing area reveals **no notes** referencing these specific planting areas, nor are there any notes indicating rules or restrictions for planting under or near the overhead electric lines on this specific sheet.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1461,"outputTokens":501,"totalTokens":4970,"reasoningTokens":3008},"warnings":[],"request":{"body":{"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"file","mediaType":"image/jpeg","data":"[BINARY_DATA_REMOVED - length: 1755680]"},{"type":"text","text":"# Your task\n\nYou are analyzing a subset of a real estate development site plan submission document.\n\nVisually analyze the binary file provided with extreme accuracy. Pay close attention to tables, reproducing them EXACTLY as they appear, character-by-character.\n\nCRITICAL: Do not paraphrase, interpret, or \"fill in\" text. If you cannot read something clearly, state \"text unclear\" rather than guessing. Transcribe field labels and values exactly as wri