. Are there parking areas shown on this plan, and if so, are any near transformer locations?\n8. Are utility easements shown relative to fire lanes or hydrant locations?\n\nProvide specific compass directions and building references."}]}],"headers":{"user-agent":"ai/5.0.152"}}},"response":{"id":"aitxt-5gaFwOJPfdhtqicwJRaWsj9J","timestamp":{},"modelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","headers":{"access-control-allow-headers":"Content-Type, Authorization, ai-gateway-auth-method, ai-gateway-protocol-version, ai-model-id, ai-language-model-id, ai-language-model-specification-version, ai-image-model-specification-version, ai-embedding-model-specification-version, ai-language-model-streaming, ai-reporting-tags, ai-reporting-user, http-referer, x-title, anthropic-beta","access-control-allow-methods":"GET, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE, OPTIONS","access-control-allow-origin":"*","cache-control":"public, max-age=0, must-revalidate","content-encoding":"br","content-type":"application/json","date":"Thu, 23 Apr 2026 18:45:57 GMT","server":"Vercel","strict-transport-security":"max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload","transfer-encoding":"chunked","vary":"rsc, next-router-state-tree, next-router-prefetch, next-router-segment-prefetch","x-matched-path":"/v1/ai/language-model","x-vercel-cache":"MISS","x-vercel-id":"cle1::cle1::krr6z-1776969924338-7dd714bb6e99"},"body":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a precise visual analysis of the provided Fire Protection Plan, here are the answers to your questions:\n\n**1. Where are the fire lanes located on the plan? What areas do they cover?**\nThe fire lanes are depicted as a continuous loop road inside the property, outlined with dashed lines and labeled periodically with the text \"Fire Lane\".\n*   **Entrance/Exit:** It connects to the public right-of-way (Valley View Road) on the west side of the site.\n*   **Internal Routing:** From the entrance, it travels east between Buildings 1 & 3 (to the north) and Buildings 2 & 4 (to t