{"level":30,"time":1776970186339,"pid":55640,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":2,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01Y56BizseXLTCpUE2ya3oz4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WA5gcgbUMSQPeYkdLATJU7","name":"mcp__conductor_tools__vision","input":{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":31,"prompt":"Examine the Landscape Plan for trees and their proximity to transformer pad locations shown on the electrical plan (Sheet 21). Provide:\n\n1. How many trees are shown on the landscape plan?\n2. What are the tree species and sizes indicated?\n3. Are tree locations marked with plant symbols and labels (species codes like \"SY\", \"PL\", \"P\", \"M\")?\n4. Where are trees positioned relative to the main driveway/internal circulation loop on the west/central portion of the site?\n5. Are there any trees or shrubs shown within 10 lateral feet of the transformer pad locations (which on Sheet 21 are located: Pad 1 NW, Pad 2 W-Central, Pad 3 SW, Pad 4 E-Central, Pad 5 SE)?\n6. Are there landscape features (groundcover, shrubs) shown near transformer locations?\n7. Are root barriers indicated for any trees?\n8. Are there planting details or notes about tree species compatibility with utilities?\n9. What is the distance from planted trees to the nearest paved surfaces/driveways?\n10. Are overhead utility lines or electric easement areas noted on the landscape plan?\n\nUse compass directions and visual estimates based on the scale 1\" = 20'."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1437,"cache_read_input_tokens":56804,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1437},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"pa