le items cannot be verified because electrical infrastructure is not cross-referenced on the landscape plan (EL-2.7, EL-2.8, EL-2.9)\n\n\n3. Without species data and ECM Appendix F reference materials, I cannot confirm adequate clearances or mature growth patterns (EL-2.1, EL-2.3)\n4. Documentation of Austin Energy approval for trees within restricted zones is absent (EL-2.15)\n\nThe evaluation is complete.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4481,"cache_read_input_tokens":73108,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4481},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2af985ee-646f-4363-9e8d-5974ccc4a371","uuid":"3adce043-ac77-447a-9028-8e8e78b904ee"}
{"level":30,"time":1776970717655,"pid":55640,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":1,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01Xm75PWGhj2o1zjQyvawsMG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Summary\n\nI have completed the site plan review for **Grouping 2: Tree Clearances from Overhead Electric Lines** for the Valley View Townhomes project.\n\n### Key Findings:\n\n**1 FAIL Item:**\n- **EL-2.10**: Plant legend/schedule does not identify species of trees proposed near electric facilities. The landscape plan shows five mitigation trees adjacent to the overhead electric line on the southern boundary labeled only as \"M\" with generic symbols. Specific species names must be provided on the landscape plan or with a clear legend linking symbols to species.\n\n**8 NOT-VERIFIABLE Items:**\n- **EL-2.1, EL-2.3**: Clearance zones for distribution lines - trees plotted 5-10 feet from OHE line, but specific species and mature heights cannot be verified without cross-referencing to separate sheets and ECM Appendix F\n- **EL-2.6**: Utility pole locations not explicitly marked on landscape plan\n- **EL-2.7, EL-2.8, EL-2.9**: Pad-mounted and underground electrical equipment locations from Sheet 21 not shown on landscape plan (Sheet 31), preventing clearance verification\n- **EL-2.11**: Large trees not differentiated by mature height category on landscape plan\n- **EL-2.15**: No documented Austin Energy written approval for trees in restricted clearance zones\n\n### Primary Issues:\n1. **Incomplete plan cross-referencing**: Electrical infrastructure from Sheet 21 not depicted on landscape plan (Sheet 31)\n2. **Missing species identification**: Trees near utilities not labeled with common/scientific names on landscape plan\n3. **No Austin Energy approval documentation**: Trees within restricted clearance zones lack written variance approval\n\nThe structured findings have been output with full code citations, sheet references, and specific comments for each deficiency item."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4481,"cache_read_input_tokens":73108,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4481},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2af985ee-646f-4363-9e8d-5974ccc4a371","uuid":"b77ee375-ed25-490e-831b-b198cd5d0932"}
