 Calculations (Plant Schedule)"}],"comment":"Five mitigation trees are plotted 5-10 feet from the overhead electric line, well within the 25-foot clearance zone required for large trees (mature height ≥40 feet per ECM Appendix F). The mature heights of proposed tree species cannot be confirmed from the landscape plan alone; cross-reference to Sheet 35 planting specifications and ECM Appendix F mature height classifications is required."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-2.6","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["entire site, proposed trees throughout landscape plan"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Overhead electric utility pole locations are not explicitly marked or dimensioned on the landscape plan (Sheet 31). While the OHE line is shown, individual pole positions must be inferred. Clearances from proposed trees to poles (minimum 10 lateral feet required) cannot be verified without explicit pole location callouts."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-2.7","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["electrical service areas, building vicinity"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Pad-mounted transformer locations shown on Sheet 21 (Electrical Plan) are not cross-referenced or depicted on Sheet 31 (Landscape Plan). Clearances from proposed trees to pad-mount equipment (minimum 10 lateral feet required, or between access door and drivable surface) cannot be verified from landscape plan alone."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-2.8","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["electrical service areas throughout site"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-