{"level":30,"time":1776970723583,"pid":55640,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01TARhbZ3xin81qmtKrnLGTq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! Now I have the tree list. Key findings:\n- Most surveyed trees are marked with \"Y\" in the APPENDIX F column, meaning they're ECM Appendix F compliant species\n- Some trees are marked \"I\" (invasive) or \"N\" (non-Appendix F)\n- Species present include: Live Oak, China Berry (invasive), Hackberry, Cedar Elm, Pecan, American Elm, Poplar, Arizona Ash, Bradford Pear (invasive), Pine\n\nNow I need to cross-reference which trees are near the transformer pads. From the electrical plan (Sheet 21), I saw 4 transformer pads:\n1. Northwest Transformer (near Bldg 2) - underneath tree canopies\n2. East Central Transformer (between Bldg 4 & 5) - adjacent to tree canopies  \n3. Southwest Transformer (near Bldg 8) - underneath tree canopy\n4. Southeast Transformer (between Bldg 6 & 7) - underneath/adjacent to tree canopy\n\nThe critical issue is: The transformer pads are shown underneath/within existing tree canopies. The grouping requires:\n- EL-13.13: Trees within 10 lateral feet of pad-mounted equipment must be utility-compatible\n- EL-13.14: Shrubs need 10 ft clearance from access door side, 5 ft from others\n- EL-13.15: Trees within 20 lateral feet of underground electric equipment need root barriers\n\nLet me now check the main site plan (Sheet 9) to understand building configurations, parking areas, clearances to sidewalks, and other features that affect transformer clearances.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6176,"cache_read_input_tokens":47180,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6176},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b8749633-cddc-4008-9f86-e2f0ef414315","uuid":"bdb7b505-754d-4a65-82eb-62bbb1ab4cec"}
