esult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/wnavey/code/controlroom/conductor/workspace/projects/63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a/primary-site-plan/sheet-32/blocks.md","content":"# Sheet 32 — Content Blocks\n\n## Block 4: text_block — Contact information for Blu Fish Collaborative Landscape Architecture.\n\n107 Leland Street, Suite 2\nAustin, TX 78704\n\nP.O. BOX 40792\nAustin, TX 78704\n\nPhone: (512) 388-4115\n\n## Block 5: text_block — Name and information of the project owner.\n\nOWNER:\nWM 41 AUSTIN\nRE, LLC\n\n## Block 6: text_block — Note indicating the source and date of the tree survey.\n\n* TREE SURVEY PROVIDED BY\nSINCLAIR LAND SURVERYING, INC.\nSURVEY DATE: 03/28/2025\n\n## Block 7: text_block — Location of the project.\n\nPROJECT LOCATION:\n3759 VALLEY\nVIEW ROAD,\nAUSTIN,\nTEXAS 78704\n\n## Block 8: text_block — Date the document was sealed.\n\nDATE SEALED:\n02/13/2026\n\n## Block 11: text_block — Label indicating a professional seal.\n\nPROFESSIONAL SEAL:\n\n## Block 12: text_block — Name of the project.\n\nPROJECT NAME:\nVALLEY VIEW\nTOWNHOMES\n\n","numLines":48,"startLine":1,"totalLines":48}}}
