uipment.\n\n**9. What is the distance from planted trees to the nearest paved surfaces/driveways?**\nBased on visual estimation using the provided graphic scale (\"SCALE IN FEET (1\"=20'-0\")\"), many of the proposed planted trees—particularly the \"SY M\" trees along the western driveway and the \"PL M\" tree in the central island—appear to be planted very close to the pavement edge, roughly **2 to 5 feet** from the nearest paved surface or curb.\n\n**10. Are overhead utility lines or electric easement areas noted on the landscape plan?**\n*   **Overhead Utility Lines:** Yes. There is a dashed line labeled **\"-OHE-\"** (Overhead Electric) running horizontally along the southern property boundary.\n*   **Easements:** No text explicitly labeling a \"Public Utility Easement\" or similar electric easement is visible on this specific sheet.","providerOptions":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}]}]},"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerAttempts":[{"provider":"vertex","internalModelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","providerApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","credentialType":"system","success":true,"startTime":112904.09742,"endTime":154289.059322,"statusCode":200,"providerResponseId":"32vqaamyBcWDjbIP6ZXkwQI"}]}],"totalProviderAttemptCount":1},"cost":"0.049898","marketCost":"0.049898","inferenceCost":"0.049898