nk center or canopy edge\n5. **Measurement reference points**: Not clear if measurements are from pole centerline or outside conductor (though measuring from conductor is required per grouping guidance)\n6. **Voltage classification**: The electrical design plan does not specify whether the OHE lines are distribution (< 60kV) or transmission (≥ 60kV)\n\n\n7. **Mature height specifications**: The plant schedule lists container sizes (100 GAL and 45 GAL) but doesn't provide mature height projections for the proposed species\n8. **Transmission easement boundaries**: Only 5' electric easements are marked on the grading plan; transmission easement areas aren't delineated\n\nNow let me evaluate each checklist item:","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1966,"cache_read_input_tokens":72701,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1966},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"970d0b0f-6cb0-49b0-933a-a570c2e8fa2d","uuid":"9c68b1ae-6123-4cd2-9fa7-3cf64146dfff"}
