{"level":30,"time":1776970807920,"pid":55640,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":7,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011zBv8WmZfm7pQZ5KNX7KHN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The search shows references in sheets dealing with utilities (27, 25, 21, 20). Let me check if any of these mention transmission or transmission easements. But actually, looking back at the facts.md file, I noted that there were \"5' Electric Easements\" mentioned, not transmission easements. And the grouping file states that transmission facilities typically have \"dedicated easements with special plat notes.\"\n\nFrom my review of facts.md earlier, I saw:\n- \"Easement 7 & 8 — 5' Electric Easements (×2)\"\n- No mention of transmission easements or 50+ foot transmission easements\n\nThe electrical design plan (Sheet 21) mentions:\n- Overhead Electric (OHE) lines\n- Underground electric lines\n- Pad-mounted transformers\n- Pull boxes\n- No mention of transmission lines or high voltage (60kV+)\n\nThe scale of the development (39 townhome units) and the presence of pad-mounted transformers and underground distribution suggest this is a **distribution system** (< 60kV), not transmission (≥ 60kV).\n\nTherefore:\n- **EL-2.2**: NOT APPLICABLE - No transmission lines present\n- **EL-2.4**: NOT APPLICABLE - No transmission lines present\n- **EL-2.5**: NOT APPLICABLE - No transmission easement present on site\n\nFor the remaining items:\n- **EL-2.8**: Trees within 5 feet of underground equipment - The electrical plan shows pull boxes and underground lines, but landscape plan doesn't show these locations relative to trees\n- **EL-2.9**: Root barriers for trees within 20 feet of underground equipment - Landscape plan shows general notes but no specific root barrier callouts\n- **EL-2.11**: Large trees not differentiated - The landscape plan doesn't indicate which trees are \"large\" (40+ feet)\n- **EL-2.12**: Clearances from pole centerline vs conductor - No dimension lines shown, so this is not-verifiable\n\n\n- **EL-2.13**: Clearances from canopy vs trunk - No dimension lines shown, so this is not-verifiable","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1204,"cache_read_input_tokens":77328,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1204},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"970d0b0f-6cb0-49b0-933a-a570c2e8fa2d","uuid":"0cb94917-4bfd-4abb-bad0-dff9bb2dc959"}
