ative to each other\n\nThis creates substantial compliance risk because Austin Energy Design and regulatory compliance require documented clearance verification. The absence of these dimensions prevents independent verification of compliance from the available documentation.\n\n### ITEMS PASSING\nThe following items pass based on available evidence:\n- **EL-13.1** - 5-foot building clearance (all pads 7.6+ feet from buildings)\n- **EL-13.38** - Bollard requirement for 4-foot parking clearance (Pad 1 is 18.2 feet from traffic area)\n- **EL-13.4, 11, 29, 30** - N/A (no reduced clearances, confined spaces, or niche installations shown)\n- Other N/A items (no dumpsters, no gas service, etc.)\n\nThe structured findings output has been provided with all identified deficiencies."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8551,"cache_read_input_tokens":71384,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8551},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1ccf424f-5fd8-4631-ab14-3396e8bf729c","uuid":"a5298907-ce1d-4c52-a59c-3b901f276df0"}
