{"level":30,"time":1776971067496,"pid":55640,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":9,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01EUoN2s2FxKP4Xz4ocX768v","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have successfully completed the review and provided findings for all deficient items. Let me verify that I've provided output in the correct format and with the correct information.\n\nI've identified 17 fail findings and 1 not-verifiable finding. All of these relate to missing clearance documentation, missing surveyed data, missing dimension annotations, or missing required notes on the plans.\n\nThe key deficiencies are:\n1. No building elevation sheets with surveyed conductor data (EL-1.1, EL-1.7)\n2. No section/profile plans showing clearance dimensions (EL-1.3, EL-1.8, EL-1.14, EL-1.17, EL-1.18, EL-1.19, EL-1.43)\n3. No clearance documentation for specific site features (EL-1.6, EL-1.9, EL-1.23, EL-1.26, EL-1.28, EL-1.29)\n4. No surveyor mid-span data when clearances appear marginal (EL-1.31)\n5. Tree clearance and utility-compatible species verification missing (EL-1.37)\n6. Cannot verify structures aren't beneath/over the line (EL-1.27 - not-verifiable)\n7. No 48-hour notification requirement note (EL-1.46)\n\nAll items I've marked as pass or n/a are not included in my findings (as instructed), which is correct. Items that couldn't be evaluated as pass or fail due to lack of information I marked as not-verifiable, and items where the deficiency is clearly present (missing required documentation) I marked as fail.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":12,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6392,"cache_read_input_tokens":78919,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6392},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a582675-f45b-4e40-ac49-d1379f357a0d","uuid":"d1669a8b-8ba3-408a-80ab-72556270a2df"}
{"level":30,"time":1776971067496,"pid":55640,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":9,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01EUoN2s2FxKP4Xz4ocX768v","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have completed the site plan review for the **EL-MD-Exp Grouping 1: Site Feature Clearances from Overhead Electric Lines**.\n\n## Summary of Findings\n\nI identified **18 deficiencies** across 17 checklist items (1 marked as \"not-verifiable\", 17 marked as \"fail\"):\n\n**Key Issues Found:**\n\n1. **Missing Building Elevations** - No building elevation sheets with surveyed overhead conductor elevations and clearance dimensions (affects EL-1.1, EL-1.7)\n\n2. **Missing Section/Profile Plans** - No cross-sections showing vertical or horizontal clearance dimensions from the outer conductor to buildings, projections, walls, driveways, parking, or equipment (affects EL-1.3, EL-1.8, EL-1.14, EL-1.17, EL-1.18, EL-1.19, EL-1.43)\n\n3. **Missing Clearance Dimensions** - No dimension annotations showing the required 7.5-foot horizontal sky-to-ground and 15-foot radial clearances from the conductor to any site features (affects EL-1.6, EL-1.9, EL-1.23, EL-1.26, EL-1.28, EL-1.29)\n\n4. **Missing Surveyor Data** - No registered surveyor mid-span clearance measurements when vertical clearances appear marginal (EL-1.31)\n\n5. **Missing Tree Clearance Verification** - Extensive tree plantings shown but no lateral distance dimensions from trees to overhead line, and no utility-compatible species verification for trees within required clearance distances (EL-1.37)\n\n6. **Cannot Verify Structures Beneath/Over Line** - Insufficient information to confirm whether facilities are positioned directly under/over the overhead distribution line (EL-1.27 - not-verifiable)\n\n7. **Missing 48-Hour Notification Note** - Plans lack required notice to notify Austin Energy 48 hours before work near overhead lines (EL-1.46)\n\nAll findings have been documented with specific code citations (primarily UCM § 1.10.3), applicable sheet locations, and detailed comments explaining what documentation is required."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":12,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6392,"cache_read_input_tokens":78919,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6392},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a582675-f45b-4e40-ac49-d1379f357a0d","uuid":"d0f62869-ee8e-4509-a7c8-1c02ad8ec385"}
