{"level":30,"time":1776971335194,"pid":55640,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":6,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01Gg2yThSuQBLhdZKEdNJsUb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! I've successfully submitted the structured output with 7 deficiency findings:\n\n1. **EL-1.1** - NOT-VERIFIABLE: Buildings not documented to maintain 7.5-ft clearance\n2. **EL-1.7** - FAIL: No surveyed conductor elevations on building sheets\n3. **EL-1.8** - FAIL: No dimension annotations from conductors to building edges\n4. **EL-1.23** - NOT-VERIFIABLE: Cannot verify measurement methodology (pole vs. conductor)\n5. **EL-1.31** - NOT-VERIFIABLE: No surveyor data for pole locations and mid-span clearances\n6. **EL-1.37** - NOT-VERIFIABLE: Trees near overhead lines not verified as UC species\n7. **EL-1.46** - FAIL: No 48-hour notification note on plans\n\nThese findings are well-supported by:\n- Vision analysis of Sheets 1, 3, 4, 9, 21, and 31\n- Clear absence of required documentation (building elevations, clearance dimensions)\n- Presence of overhead electric infrastructure (confirmed by Sheet 3 notes and vision analysis)\n- Missing required notes and specifications\n\nThe findings appropriately balance between FAIL (deficiency is present - required item missing) and NOT-VERIFIABLE (requirement cannot be evaluated due to missing evidence).","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2022,"cache_read_input_tokens":80509,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2022},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"70b192e9-3480-432d-b26e-17170fe74ff5","uuid":"5395f9dd-27dc-48dc-82c1-0d0bba971431"}
{"level":30,"time":1776971339587,"pid":55640,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":6,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01Gg2yThSuQBLhdZKEdNJsUb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have completed the site plan review for the **EL-MD-EXP/1.md grouping** on overhead electric clearances. \n\n## Summary of Review:\n\nThis project (Valley View Townhomes) has **overhead electric transmission and distribution facilities** confirmed on and adjacent to the site. The existing conditions survey (Sheet 4) and site plan (Sheet 9) show overhead lines along the property perimeters with 5-foot electric easements, plus numerous utility poles with guy wires. Sheet 3 (General Notes) contains extensive requirements for a transmission easement with 25-foot no-dig zones, pre-construction coordination requirements, and equipment restrictions.\n\n### Key Findings:\n\nI identified **7 deficiencies** across the 47 checklist items in this grouping:\n\n1. **EL-1.7 (FAIL)** - Surveyed conductor elevations missing from building elevation sheets\n2. **EL-1.8 (FAIL)** - Electrical plan lacks clearance dimensions from conductors to building edges  \n3. **EL-1.46 (FAIL)** - No required 48-hour Austin Energy notification note on plans\n4. **EL-1.1 (NOT-VERIFIABLE)** - Building clearances cannot be verified without conductor elevation data\n5. **EL-1.23 (NOT-VERIFIABLE)** - Cannot verify clearance dimensions measured from conductor vs. pole\n6. **EL-1.31 (NOT-VERIFIABLE)** - No surveyed pole locations or mid-span clearance data provided\n7. **EL-1.37 (NOT-VERIFIABLE)** - Proposed trees near overhead lines lack species verification for utility-compatibility\n\n### Primary Issue:\n**No building elevations or sections with surveyed overhead conductor elevations were submitted**, making it impossible to verify vertical and horizontal clearances from buildings, overhangs, driveways, and other site features to the existing overhead electric infrastructure.\n\nThe structured findings have been submitted in the required format."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2022,"cache_read_input_tokens":80509,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2022},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"70b192e9-3480-432d-b26e-17170fe74ff5","uuid":"94ccd76b-5fc4-4f9a-bb2d-9f5f69bdbde1"}
